[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_UMBRUM_ARMY]
Shadowmancer

[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_UMBRUM_ARMY_desc]
The umbrums, an ancient race of wraith-like beings who used to terrorize the Crystal Empire before getting sealed away. Now they are back, a lot of them.

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_UMBRUM_ARMY]
暗影术士

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_UMBRUM_ARMY_desc]
荒原影魔，一个古老的种族，曾经在水晶帝国肆虐，后来被封印。现在他们又回来了，许多。
